 ides.wpi.edu/c.php?g=950020&p=10756538 Each Friday an email will be sent o
 ut to the group called Mindfulness Tools To-Go which will include informat
 ion about meditations\, poems shared during the week\, and mindful resourc
 es. If you have questions or suggestions\, please do not hesitate to conta
 ct Robin Benoit\, rbenoit@wpi.edu --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu
