BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traditional Irish Music Irish Music Diarmuid Ó Meachair-accordion
  & melodeon\, Ellie Egan-fiddle\, John Hannigan-accordion\, Simon Lace-gui
 tar
DTSTART:20260928T160000
DTEND:20260928T170000
DTSTAMP:20260903T152849Z
UID:428ec70462072c7fd3b929b5ae08c6@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Accordion player Diarmuid Ó Meachair and Galway fiddle player
  Ellie Egan will play a selection of music from East Galway. The tradition
 al music of East Galway is known for its unhurried pace\, lyrical expressi
 on\, and strong rhythm. Unlike the faster\, highly ornamented styles of ot
 her regions like Sligo\, the East Galway style focuses closely on the smoo
 th flow of the melody and a soulful\, down-to-earth feel. The concert will
  include music from legendary east Galway figures such as Paddy Fahey\, Pa
 ddy Kelly\, Conor Tully\, Paddy Carty and Joe Burke. They will be accompan
 ied by guitarist Simon Lace and Brooks Scholar John Hannigan (Accordion & 
 Fiddle). Dress Code: Casual (jeans ok) --- Event Details: https://myhc.hol
 ycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152725\n\nSource: College of the Holy Cross\nEvent pag
 e: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152725
LOCATION:Brooks Concert Hall\, 1 College Street\, Worcester\, MA 01610\, U
 nited States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152725
END:VEVENT
