BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Faculty Showcase Recital Musical Conversations - Aleksandra Labins
 ka-violin\, Sergio Muñoz Leiva-viola\, Sonya Ovrutsky Femsome-piano
DTSTART:20261006T233000
DTEND:20261007T003000
DTSTAMP:20260903T152849Z
UID:3ff13ff5cc49d87e66c99a5db26bfc@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:This program goes beyond showcasing virtuosity for its own sak
 e\, inviting listeners into a series of musical conversations. From the ir
 resistible pulse of Piazzolla's Libertango to the architectural clarity of
  Hindemith\, the meditative timelessness of Pärt's Fratres\, the playful 
 energy of Lauren Bernofsky's Blue Monkey\, and the lyrical warmth of Elain
 e Fine's trio\, each work offers a distinct musical voice while exploring 
 the many ways instruments can listen\, respond\, challenge\, and inspire o
 ne another. Spanning nearly a century of musical styles\, the program reve
 als how composers with remarkably different musical languages all found co
 mpelling ways to transform conversation into sound. Astor Piazzolla\, Libe
 rtango Hindemith\, Sonata for Viola and Piano Op. 11 No. 4 Arvo Pärt\, Fr
 atres Lauren Bernofsky\, Blue Monkey Elaine Fine\, Trio for Violin\, Viola
 \, and piano Dress Code: Casual (jeans ok) --- Event Details: https://myhc
 .holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152343\n\nSource: College of the Holy Cross\nEvent
  page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152343
LOCATION:Luth Concert Hall Prior Performing Arts Center\, 1 College Street
 \, Worcester\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152343
END:VEVENT
