DESCRIPTION:Take Back the Night is a community event where students\, facu
 lty\, and staff stand in solidarity with survivors of sexual violence and 
 affirm a shared commitment to a safer\, more supportive campus. The event 
 includes a peaceful march\, survivor stories\, and a guided reflection. Pa
 rticipants are welcome to support\, learn\, and share personal stories. St
 ories that are shared at this event will not initiate a Title IX report or
  investigation. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152
