DTEND:20261122T230000
DTSTAMP:20260903T152849Z
UID:c00d5c480a57a9b672addcf5e6051f@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:The purpose of this group is to support students grieving from
  the death of a loved one\, recent or years ago. Participants will have th
 e opportunity to slow down\, take time to reflect upon their grief and the
  person that they have lost and form community with other students. Meetin
 gs are held in the Chaplains' Office and facilitated by Associate Chaplain
 \, Meg Fox-Kelly\, LICSW. Day/Time of Meetings: Sunday evenings at 5PM Pla
 ce: Campion House\, Office of Meg Fox-Kelly Facilitated by Chaplains Meg F
 ox-Kelly\, LICSW Contact Meg Fox-Kelly mfox@holycross.edu with any questio
 ns. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2153868\n\nSourc
