BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Taxes: Take the Fear Out of Filing
DTSTART:20270204T230000
DTEND:20270205T001500
DTSTAMP:20260903T152849Z
UID:b904be251278e0590c26cdf8968b04@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re filing your first tax return\, working while 
 in school\, completing an internship\, or balancing multiple sources of in
 come\, this workshop will help you understand the basics of the U.S. tax s
 ystem and what you need to know when tax season arrives. We’ll cover: 
 ● How the U.S. tax system works ● What a W-2\, W-4\, and 1099 are ● 
 The difference between income and taxable income ● Federal vs. state tax
 es ● Tax withholding and why it matters ● Common tax forms students ma
 y encounter ● What to expect when filing your tax return Meeting Link: T
 BD --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403498\n\nSource: Worc
 ester Polytechnic Institute\nEvent page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403
 498
LOCATION:Online Event
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403498
END:VEVENT
