UID:6e1abd026d5ebe8dfc155ff9385fea@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Wellness Days are built into the academic calendar as days to 
 reflect\, relax\, reconnect\, and reenergize as individuals and as a campu
 s community. These are days for our community to focus on supporting and c
 aring for our students as well as each other. There will be no classes\, n
 o assignment due dates\, no non-critical lab work\, and no meetings held o
 n these days. Wellness Days will feature a variety of ways to de-stress an
 d connect with yourself and those around you throughout the day. --- Event
  Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403189\n\nSource: Worcester Polyte
 chnic Institute\nEvent page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403189
